pref-title = Extra Columns

pref-intro = Show values from an item's Extra field, or Zotero fields that have no column of their own, as columns in the item list. Add a definition for each one you want to see, then switch the column on with the item list's column picker.

pref-heading-label = Column header
pref-heading-source = Source
pref-heading-key = Extra key
pref-heading-type = Type

pref-empty = No columns yet. Add one for a key you use in Extra, or for a Zotero field.

pref-add =
    .label = Add column

pref-note = Keys are matched without regard to case or surrounding whitespace. Where a key appears more than once in Extra, the first line wins. A Zotero field column shows the fallback Extra key, if you give one, for items where the field is empty or does not apply.
